	(text "NIBBLE CARD PANEL B - FRONT PANEL, LEVELS 2: switches for OI..MAI and MI..INP with their LEDs, the CLK and RST buttons"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.5 3.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "da0d0374-3c7e-4b07-a254-a49710cdc32b")
	)
	(text "Cell: 2N7000 + 47k pull-up (NMOS, see docs/gate-cell.md).  20 transistors, 36 resistors, 16 LEDs, 100 x 100 mm (docs/cards.md).\nLevel switches connect a line to +5V through 10k: a switch left on can never fight a card that pulls the line low, it only adds a 1 where nothing else drives.\nEvery switched line has a 1Meg pull-down so it reads 0 when no card drives it.  CLK and RST come from RC-debounced buttons through a Schmitt trigger and a diode, so the clock card can drive the same lines."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71822968-100a-44dd-840e-5d6466025430")
	)
	(text "INDICATORS: one LED per bus line.  A MOSFET gate draws no current, so the LEDs load nothing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e50b6d8e-1719-4856-9808-885ba64de248")
	)
